  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Echoing Green (EG) COVID 19 - Khainza Energy Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to provide funding to Arthur Woniala to acquire inventory of 500 liquefied petroleum gas cylinders weighing 6kgs each, and to purchase motorcycles for efficient delivery purposes. In addition, funding will also be used to upgrade the companys online platforms to streamline the orders and delivery process, with remote trainings as an added feature. Rent payment for office spaces will also be covered for the months of April, May and June. Lastly, staff salary will be able to get paid off for three existing employees and eight newly recruited youths for the month of June and July. Some of the grant funds will also be used to support families of elderly farmers who have been previously diagnosed with respiratory infections, and are at great risk of contracting COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
